message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Erdős problems: an open record"
abstract: >-
  One page for each problem cataloged at erdosproblems.com, recording its
  statement, its standing with the evidence behind it, the results claimed
  about it and their sources, with a library of the literature and Lean
  formalizations.
